flowchart LR
    Request[JWT registration request] --> Key[Idempotency key]
    Key --> Event[Event and lane lookup]
    Event --> Rank[Headroom and queue ranking]
    Rank --> Allocate[Locked allocate_seat RPC]
    Allocate --> Pending[Pending registration]
    Pending --> Token[HMAC Seat Passport]
    Token --> Job[Queued notification job]
    Allocate --> Audit[Audit append]
    Job --> Send[Worker email attempt]
    Send --> Result[Sent retry or dead_letter]
    Pending --> Expiry[Expiry sweep]
    Expiry --> Queue[Queue promotion]
